 "descriptions": {
  "normal": "Recover the loose clean icons, avoid corrupt data, and leave through the exit gate.",
  "rescue": "Locate stranded civilian programs. Fly close to release every program from quarantine, then escort them toward the open route.",
  "repair": "Stabilize damaged directory nodes by remaining close while each repair cycle completes.",
  "race": "Race rival pilots through every checkpoint. First place still claims the icon cache.",
  "courier": "Meet the courier program, allow it to link with your ship, and guide it safely to the destination terminal.",
  "blackhole": "Recover the icons to expose the existing dragon black hole. Entering it still begins the Noble Program encounter.",
  "scan": "Search the directory for hidden infection signatures. Hold position near each signal until the scanner resolves it.",
  "duel": "The existing locked combat directory remains active. Destroy all hostile duelists to open the gate.",
  "defrag": "Touch the numbered memory fragments in order to rebuild the directory path.",
  "boss": "The Inner Demon stronghold. Four Noble Programs are still required before entry."
 },
